{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"haskell","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Haskell","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Haskell (.hs .lhs).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"haskell","name":"Haskell","extensions":[".hs",".lhs"],"grammar":"grammars/haskell.json","lineComment":"--","blockComment":["{-","-}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Haskell","path":"snippets/haskell.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/haskell.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|<-|=>|::|\\\\\\\\|\\\\|\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{-#[\\\\s\\\\S]*?#-\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:qualified|deriving|instance|default|foreign|newtype|family|forall|hiding|import|infixl|infixr|module|class|infix|where|case|data|else|proc|then|type|let|mdo|rec|as|do|if|in|of)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Nothing|False|Right|True|Just|Left|LT|EQ|GT)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Applicative|Ordering|Integer|Functor|Double|String|Either|Float|Maybe|Monad|Bool|Char|Show|Int|Ord|IO|Eq)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:putStrLn|filter|lookup|return|length|foldr|foldl|print|show|read|pure|fmap|head|tail|map|zip)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/haskell.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function with signature\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} :: ${2:Int} -> ${3:Int}\",\n      \"${1:name} ${4:x} = $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function and its type\"\n  },\n  \"Data type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"data\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"data ${1:Name} = ${2:Con} ${3:Int}\",\n      \"  deriving (Show, Eq)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A data type\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:Main} where\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module header\"\n  },\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"main :: IO ()\",\n      \"main = do\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"main\"\n  },\n  \"Case\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"case\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case ${1:x} of\",\n      \"  ${2:pattern} -> $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"case of\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Haskell\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Haskell.\n\n## Files\n\n`.hs`, `.lhs`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fn` | A function and its type |\n| `data` | A data type |\n| `mod` | A module header |\n| `main` | main |\n| `case` | case of |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}